  "review": {
    "summary": "The subset defines strong fail-closed scanner, exploration, artifact, and verification contracts, but two security-boundary defects block PASS: artifact readers are launched through ambient Python resolution, and Playwright's claimed residual-credential check is only an idempotence check.",
    "scores": {
      "semantic_correctness": 90,
      "false_positive_control": 92,
      "security_trust_boundaries": 68,
      "verification_design": 92,
      "scope_contract_consistency": 93,
      "docs_usability": 91
    },
    "findings": [
      {
        "severity": "H",
        "category": "security_trust_boundaries",
        "file": "skills/playwright-debugger/SKILL.md",
        "line": 189,
        "title": "Artifact reader uses ambient Python resolution",
        "evidence": "The prescribed pre-trust artifact-reading command starts with unqualified `python3`, so an activated project-local environment or project-containing PATH can select target-controlled executable code before the bundled reader validates the artifact.",
        "recommendation": "Provide and prescribe a bundled launcher that binds and validates an absolute non-project Python interpreter under an isolated environment; use the same boundary for Cypress readers."
      },
      {
        "severity": "H",
        "category": "security_trust_boundaries",
        "file": "skills/playwright-debugger/scripts/read-playwright-artifact.py",
        "line": 1259,
        "title": "Residual credential check is ineffective",
        "evidence": "After assigning `value = redact_sensitive(value)`, the code only compares a second application of the same sanitizer with the first result. Any credential shape missed by the sanitizer remains unchanged and therefore passes this check, contrary to the documented fail-closed residual-credential guarantee.",
        "recommendation": "After redaction, run independent residual credential detectors over every emitted string and fail when any supported authorization, cookie, assignment, URL-userinfo, or query-secret shape remains."
      }
    ],
